/// Jadpo's own OpenAI package moved out of this repository into jadpo-dev/package-openai, so this
/// example installs it by git tag until jadpo.dev's registry, which verifies publishers, publishes
/// it as @jadpo/open-ai. OpenAI's API has no call to erase what it was sent, so the descriptions of
/// lost items it reads stay with OpenAI for as long as OpenAI keeps them.
acceptance {
    changes: {
        OpenAi.v1: PackageChange.git_source
        openai: ErasureNotPossible.data_stays
    }
}
